RKCert.ReviewedNative.SDIRK8HalfQuadraticReceipts.threeTapRead.{u_1} {R : Type u_1} [CommRing R]
  (a b s u v w fa fb fs m0 m1 m2 : R) (h0 : u + v + w = m0) (h1 : a * u + b * v + s * w = m1)
  (h2 : a ^ 2 * u + b ^ 2 * v + s ^ 2 * w = m2) :
  (a - b) * (a - s) * (b - s) * (u * fa + v * fb + w * fs) =
    (b - s) * (m2 - (b + s) * m1 + b * s * m0) * fa + (s - a) * (m2 - (a + s) * m1 + a * s * m0) * fb +
      (a - b) * (m2 - (a + b) * m1 + a * b * m0) * fs
'RKCert.ReviewedNative.SDIRK8HalfQuadraticReceipts.threeTapRead' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
